(defun pcap:generate(/ mrx mtx gap sgp tx rx xangle xbase1 ybase1 xbase2 ybase2 xa ya xb yb xc yc xd yd xaa yaa row col row1 col1 dt xe ye xf yf xg yg ee ff gg)
